WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,160
I'll go in, I'll go in

2
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:06,980
How old are you?

3
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:07,980
Still playing this trick

4
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:09,500
Look there are flying butterflies

5
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:13,070
Come in, Lao Deng

6
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:17,780
You want to scare me and run away

7
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:21,510
You heard my wife's screams

8
00:00:21,510 --> 00:00:23,830
If he just died in the dungeon, it would be fine.

9
00:00:23,830 --> 00:00:25,750
No matter what happened between you two before, don't listen to him

10
00:00:25,750 --> 00:00:26,990
If you feel there is danger, call the police

11
00:00:27,910 --> 00:00:29,030
I also want to call the police

12
00:00:29,030 --> 00:00:30,310
But I can't do it

13
00:00:30,550 --> 00:00:31,910
To see my parents again

14
00:00:31,910 --> 00:00:33,590
I paid too much

15
00:00:33,870 --> 00:00:35,870
I don't mean to blame you. Don't cry.

16
00:00:35,870 --> 00:00:37,230
It's not you who did the wrong thing

17
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:45,580
All interns

18
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:47,300
Wear your official badge and work clothes

19
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:48,620
Gather on the first floor
